STATUS should be one of next:
	'online',
	'idle',
	'dnd',
	'invisible'.

STATUS_TYPE should be one of next:
	'Playing' (Playing [name]),
	'Streaming' (Streaming [name]) (requires a Twitch/YouTube URL),
	'Listening' (Listening to [name]),
	'Watching' (Watching [name]),
	'Competing' (Competing in [name]).

SOUND_VOLUME should be from '0.01' to '1.0'.

STATUS=online
